From 4d4381948cf42cfcba9bec3e7840436da5511edd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 04:30:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat: engine fixes for agent tool output, plugin-facing
 API (Phase 1a)

- Critical-line regex flag bug fixed; quadratic hot spots removed (650 KB log
  22 s -> <1 s).
- Logs keep one exemplar per ERROR fingerprint; N6 restore keeps order;
  filler queries ("continue", "thanks") no longer cause high-risk cuts.
- New kwargs gap_marker / recursion_markers / content_hint; helpers
  error_fingerprints, brief_context, extract_evidence_lines, contains_secret,
  unwrap/rewrap_tool_payload (Hermes wrapper fields survive), ENGINE_VERSION.
- transcript: text_of, task_query, orphan tool calls no longer block the
  trajectory gate; sync_to_harness.py --check.
- integration/hermes bundle and the nine Hermes-gated tests removed in favour
  of hermes-tameru-plugin.

